# Incident 2024-11-02

Hi ⟦PERSON:Priya⟧,

between 02:10 and 02:40 we saw failed logins from ⟦IP:52.14.200.31⟧ and ⟦IP:185.220.101.4⟧ against the VPN gateway
⟦HOST:vpn.northwind-traders.com⟧. The attacker then pivoted to ⟦IP:192.168.44.12⟧ (⟦HOST:fileserver02.corp⟧) and to ⟦IP:10.8.0.15⟧.
IPv6 source was ⟦IPV6:2a02:26f0:1700::b819:1d4⟧. The laptop NIC was ⟦MAC:3c:22:fb:7a:19:e0⟧.

Not interesting: localhost 127.0.0.1 and ::1, wildcard 0.0.0.0, netmask 255.255.255.0, broadcast 255.255.255.255.
The agent reports version 4.17.21.3 and build 10.0.19045. Timestamps like 02:10:33 and 12:30:45 are plain times.

Regards,
